    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "redefining things sounds so exhausting though. like, what's the point of building something new when the foundation was just a lie to begin with? it feels like the structure was the only thing making life tolerable. without it, everything just feels... heavy. empty. like i'm just wasting time existing for no reason.",
